<title>USA: Allwaste posts record quarterly earnings.</title>
<headline>Allwaste posts record quarterly earnings.</headline>
<dateline>HOUSTON 1997-07-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Allwaste Inc Wednesday posted record quarterly earnings of $4.0 million, or $0.10 a share, compared with $2.6 million, or $0.07 a share, the year before.</p>
<p>An April 5 First Call estimate of 5 brokers put industrial services company's earnings at $0.09 a share for the quarter ended May 31.</p>
<p>The quarterly results probably marked Allwaste's last earnings report in the face of the proposed merger with Philip Services Corp.</p>
</text>
